{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:57 2026-11-02 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:57 2026-11-02 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:57 2026-11-02 HKT</p><img alt=\"美股三大指數開市向好 科技股領漲 亞馬遜升4% \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/9747613d80efee6d6cc5d3b552edc424/2026-11/stock_photo_4_1200x676.jpg\"/><p>踏入11月，美股開市一洗10月頹勢，3大指數向好，道指升0.85%、納指升0.82%，標普500指數升0.55%。</p><p>科技股領漲，亞馬遜（AMZN）升4%、SpaceX（SPCX）升4%、英偉達（NVDA）升2%。惟將發行100億美元債券的甲骨文（ORCL）跌5.2%。</p><p>中概股普遍向好，其中富途控股（FUTU）升4%、阿里巴巴（BABA）升5.6%、拼多多（PDD）升4.7%、攜程網（TCOM）升約3%。</p><p></p><p></p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T15:21:11.707794+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":286,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T14:57:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T23:18:41.181923+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T15:18:30.615478+00:00","content_hash":"2497c7722d73275b2b5f791a6f15e98322860e07cfebeb29ad236cd6afdccdf6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}